# All text files are LF in the repository AND in the working tree,
# regardless of each machine's core.autocrlf setting. eol=lf (not just
# text=auto) because Prettier enforces its default endOfLine: "lf" — with
# CRLF working trees every `npm run format` on Windows rewrites files to LF
# and recreates the "modified but empty diff" stat noise this file removes.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never subject to text normalization or diffing.
*.woff2 binary
*.woff binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
